-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ו/8 (5.7.2016): קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ו;
-- קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה בחינוך הגופני; קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה בחינוך הטכנולוגי
-- The clothing allowance for school year 2015-16 (level 4, pro rata to the
-- position, the caps on employment volume), the additional allowance for
-- physical-education teachers by employment band, and the additional
-- allowance in technological education by profession.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT property_checks
IMPORT `clothing-recuperation-circulars-common`

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the clothing
-- allowance is paid pro rata to the position, up to one full position, and
-- the cap of 140% of a position across all employers restates the
-- agreements' limit on employment beyond a full position. A cap takes away
-- no rest and adds no hour; the weeks the agreements allow beyond a full
-- position are weighed where they set them (the takanon's §1.24, the base
-- agreement's §33, the Oz agreement's §14).

§ `חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ו/8 — קצובת ביגוד תשע"ו`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, the ministry's address, the date (5.7.2016), the reference number, the addressee and the three-item subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `tashav-8 clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ו/8` HAS `clothing amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ו/8` HAS `additional amount paid` IS A NUMBER
    `work beyond the employment cap in circular תשע"ו/8`
    `employ beyond the employment cap in circular תשע"ו/8`

§§ `1 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ו`

-- akn:art_1/p1 The heading "תחולה" (application); no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p3 "By the Treasury's instructions on the clothing allowance, act as follows": an introduction to the paragraphs below.
-- akn:art_1/p4 The heading "כללי" (general); no rule.

-- §1, application: every employee graded as a teaching employee and
-- employed by an owner the ministry supervises.
@ref akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee under circular תשע"ו/8` c IF
    c's `graded as a teaching employee` AND c's `employed by a supervised owner`

-- §1ב: entitled to the clothing allowance as public-facing staff in the
-- civil service, for school year 2015-16 (09/15–08/16).
@ref akn:art_1__para_b
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ו/8` c IF
    `a teaching employee under circular תשע"ו/8` c

-- §1ג: at level 4, that is 2,091 NIS.
@ref akn:art_1__para_c
`the level-4 clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS 2091

-- §1ד: pro rata to the position, at most one full position.
-- akn:art_1__para_d `clothing position share` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

-- §1ה: with more than one employer and above 100% in total, each employer
-- pays the share for the position held with it — the reading adopted for
-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-a, where §1ד's cap and §1ה part.
@ref akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
      `employed by more than one employer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `each employer pays its own clothing share in circular תשע"ו/8` c `employed by more than one employer` IF
    `employed by more than one employer`
    AND c's `position with all the employers` GREATER THAN 1

@export default The clothing allowance a teaching employee is owed by one employer for school year 2015-16 under owners' circular 2015-16/8
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case` @desc the employee's year at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` c IS
    IF `entitled to the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ו/8` c
    THEN `the level-4 clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` TIMES `clothing position share` c
    ELSE 0

-- §1א: paid in full with July 2016's salary (school month 11).
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `clothing case`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashav-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the clothing allowance with July 2016's salary` c IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ו/8` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` c
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2015-16/8 section 1a: the clothing allowance is paid in full with July 2016's salary"

§§ `1ו The caps on employment volume`

-- §1ו: 140% for every teaching employee, 150% for a principal outside the
-- reforms; ¶2: 125% under Oz LaTmura in full implementation and 117% under
-- Ofek Hadash; all with all employers together.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f akn:art_1__para_f/p2
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teacher outside the reforms` THEN 1.4
    WHEN `a principal outside the reforms` THEN 1.5
    WHEN `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `a teacher in Ofek Hadash` THEN 1.17

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-f: the first sentence of §1ו limits EVERY teaching employee to 140%
-- and a principal outside the reform to 150%, so that principal has two
-- limits, and the closing summary lists only the 140%. Reading adopted, as
-- in F-2019-20_tashaf_11-a: the principal's own 150% governs a principal.
-- `the limits §1ו sets` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

`a non-reform principal is given both 140% and 150% in circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
    `the limits §1ו sets` `a principal outside the reforms` EQUALS LIST 1.4, 1.5
#ASSERT `a non-reform principal is given both 140% and 150% in circular תשע"ו/8`

-- The two restrictions, lifted where the exceptional-employment procedure
-- approves the employment (below).
GIVEN `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashav-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `the cap on the teacher's work of circular תשע"ו/8` `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the teaching employee`
         SHANT `work beyond the employment cap in circular תשע"ו/8`
         LEST BREACH BY `the teaching employee` BECAUSE "circular 2015-16/8 section 1f: the teaching employee is restricted from working beyond the cap with all employers"

GIVEN `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashav-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `the cap on the employer of circular תשע"ו/8` `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS
    IF `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the employer`
         SHANT `employ beyond the employment cap in circular תשע"ו/8`
         LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2015-16/8 section 1f: employment beyond the cap is not permitted"

-- §1ו ¶3 and §1 ¶5: subject to the 2015-16 exceptional-employment
-- procedure (named, not reproduced: an input); the circular neither changes
-- the conditions for approval nor permits employment beyond the caps. The
-- text sets no time limit on either restriction.
@ref akn:art_1__para_f/p3 akn:art_1/p5
GIVEN t IS AN `employment track`
      `total position` IS A NUMBER @desc the position with all employers together (1 = 100%)
      `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc approved under the 2015-16 exceptional-employment procedure, which this circular names and does not reproduce
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employment within the cap` t `total position` `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure` IF
    `total position` AT MOST `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` t
    OR `approved under the exceptional-employment procedure`

#ASSERT `employment within the cap` `a teacher in Oz LaTmura in full implementation` 1.25 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`employment within the cap` `a teacher outside the reforms` 1.45 FALSE)

§§ `2 קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- §2 ¶1: in addition to the general allowance (and covering sun protection).
-- akn:art_2/p1 `the physical-education allowance is in addition to the general one` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

-- §2's table as printed: the amounts of circular 2011-12/8 updated, as at
-- 1/9/15, by the employment rate. 999 stands for "ומעלה" (and above).
@ref akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/t1
`the physical-education table of circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
    LIST `physical-education band` 0 TRUE 0.3 TRUE 0,
         `physical-education band` 0.3 TRUE 0.5 TRUE 667,
         `physical-education band` 0.5 TRUE 999 TRUE 1331

-- The rows as printed, each bound inclusive, only to show where they meet
-- (thresholds.shared-bound): no operative rule reads this list; the rule
-- that answers gives a shared bound to the row that opens at it.
GIVEN r IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the table gives for rate` r IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `the physical-education band takes` r b)
                `the physical-education table of circular תשע"ו/8`)

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-b: "עד 0.3" and "מ-0.3", "עד 0.5" and "מ-0.5" — the
-- bounds 0.3 and 0.5 are each in two rows.
`the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each in circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
        `the amounts the table gives for rate` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 667
    AND `the amounts the table gives for rate` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 667, 1331
#ASSERT `the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each in circular תשע"ו/8`

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-e: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the employee's whole position. The
-- reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_08-c and its siblings read the same
-- words: the share in physical education, the input `employment rate`.
`the two readings of the employment rate differ in circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the table gives for rate` 0.2
         EQUALS `the amounts the table gives for rate` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ in circular תשע"ו/8`

-- The reading adopted: the row that opens at a bound governs it.
@desc The physical-education teacher's employment rate is the table's "שיעור העסקה" read as the share of the position in physical education (1 = a full position).
GIVEN `employment rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` `employment rate` IS
    BRANCH IF `employment rate` `has reached the row from` 0.5 THEN 1331
           IF `employment rate` `has reached the row from` 0.3 THEN 667
           OTHERWISE 0

#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD `the amounts the table gives for rate` r EQUALS LIST (`physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` r))
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.49, 0.51, 1, 1.4)

§§ `3 קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

-- §3.1א's list, in its printed numbering (1-13).
-- akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a/t1 `the professions with shoes and two coats` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

-- §3.1ב's list, in its printed numbering (1-13).
-- akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b/t1 `the professions with two coats` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

#ASSERT count `the professions with shoes and two coats` EQUALS 13
#ASSERT count `the professions with two coats` EQUALS 13
-- No profession is on both lists.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD NOT elem p `the professions with two coats`) `the professions with shoes and two coats`

-- §3.1א ¶2 and §3.1ב ¶2: the value of a pair of shoes and two coats, and of two coats.
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a/p2
`the value of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS 550
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b/p2
`the value of two coats of circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS 342

-- §3 ¶1, §3.1א–ב: a teaching employee in technological education or a
-- vocational instructor in a listed profession gets the items each year.
-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-d: a teacher of professions on both lists meets §3.1א and
-- §3.1ב. The reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_13-c and its siblings
-- read the same words: the larger grant, which holds the two coats the
-- other grants.
@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN `professions` IS A LIST OF STRING @desc the professions taught, as the lists print them
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the full-position technological allowance` `professions` IS
    IF `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with shoes and two coats` `professions`
    THEN `the value of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ו/8`
    ELSE IF `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with two coats` `professions`
         THEN `the value of two coats of circular תשע"ו/8`
         ELSE 0

GIVEN list IS A LIST OF STRING
      `professions` IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` list `professions` IF
    any (GIVEN q YIELD elem q list) `professions`

-- The other reading of F-2015-16_tashav_08-d: both grants, added.
GIVEN `professions` IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `both grants added of circular תשע"ו/8` `professions` IS
    (IF `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with shoes and two coats` `professions` THEN `the value of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ו/8` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with two coats` `professions` THEN `the value of two coats of circular תשע"ו/8` ELSE 0)

-- §3.3: pro rata to the position, at most one full position.
@ref akn:art_3__para_3
GIVEN `professions` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` `professions` `position` IS
    `the full-position technological allowance` `professions` TIMES min `position` 1

-- §3.2: in addition to the general allowance.
-- akn:art_3__para_2 `the technological allowance is in addition to the general one` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, the signatures (Sonia Peretz, head of the senior division for teaching staff) and the list of copies; no rule.

§§ `§1ד against §1ה (finding a)`

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-a: 70% at one employer and 60% at another: §1ה pays
-- 1.3 allowances in all, §1ד's cap allows one.
-- `the clothing shares §1ה pays at two employers` is declared once, in clothing-recuperation-circulars-common, which this file imports.
#ASSERT `§1ד and §1ה give a two-employer teacher different totals`

§§ `No payment month for sections 2 and 3 (finding c)`

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-c: §1א dates the general allowance (July 2016's
-- salary); §2 and §3 name no month for theirs. The reading adopted, by
-- convention dates.no-deadline (conventions.toml): the additional allowances
-- are owed with no deadline, since no stated time is no deadline; July binds
-- the general allowance only.
GIVEN `professions` IS A LIST OF STRING
      `position` IS A NUMBER
      `employment rate` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashav-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the additional allowances of circular תשע"ו/8` `professions` `position` `employment rate` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ו/8` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST (`technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` `professions` `position`
                                      PLUS `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` `employment rate`)
    LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2015-16/8 sections 2-3, no month stated: the additional allowances are owed with no deadline"

DECLARE `tashav-8 section of the circular` IS ONE OF `section 1 in circular תשע"ו/8`, `section 2`, `section 3`
GIVEN s IS A `tashav-8 section of the circular`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `names a payment month in circular תשע"ו/8` s IF
    CONSIDER s
    WHEN `section 1 in circular תשע"ו/8` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

`sections 2 and 3 of circular תשע"ו/8 name no payment month` MEANS
    (NOT `names a payment month in circular תשע"ו/8` `section 2`) AND NOT `names a payment month in circular תשע"ו/8` `section 3`
#ASSERT `sections 2 and 3 of circular תשע"ו/8 name no payment month`

§§ `Worked examples`

#ASSERT `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` `a full-position teacher at one employer` EQUALS 2091
#ASSERT `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` `a half-position teacher` EQUALS 1045.5
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` (LIST "מכטרוניקה") 0.5 EQUALS 275
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` (LIST "סיעוד") 1.2 EQUALS 342
#ASSERT `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` (LIST "מתמטיקה") 1 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` 0.4 EQUALS 667

#TRACE `paying the clothing allowance with July 2016's salary` `a full-position teacher at one employer` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ו/8` 2091 AT 11
#TRACE `paying the clothing allowance with July 2016's salary` `a full-position teacher at one employer` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ו/8` 1000 AT 11
#TRACE `paying the additional allowances of circular תשע"ו/8` (LIST "מכטרוניקה") 1 0.6 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ו/8` 1881 AT 11

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-d: a teacher of מכטרוניקה and מערכות אלקטרוניות is on both lists,
-- and the two readings part.
`a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants in circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
    LET l MEANS LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות"
    IN      `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with shoes and two coats` l
        AND `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with two coats` l
        AND NOT (`both grants added of circular תשע"ו/8` l EQUALS `the full-position technological allowance` l)
#ASSERT `a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants in circular תשע"ו/8`

-- F-2015-16_tashav_08-g: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
    `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` 0.4 PLUS `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` 0.4
        GREATER THAN `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` 0.8
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשע"ו/8`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: graded and supervised or not;
-- positions here and with all employers in tenths from 0 to 1.5; every
-- employment track, approved or not; physical-education shares in tenths;
-- every profession of either list, none, one on neither and one of each.

`every profession list checked of circular תשע"ו/8` MEANS
    append (LIST EMPTY, (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות"), (LIST "מתמטיקה"))
           (map (GIVEN q YIELD LIST q) (append `the professions with shoes and two coats` `the professions with two coats`))

-- §1 over every flag and position: the allowance is never negative, is
-- level 4 pro rata to the position here up to one full position, nothing
-- outside the circular, and never falls with a larger position.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN o YIELD
                        all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                LET c MEANS `clothing case` g o p p
                                    a MEANS `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` c
                                IN      a EQUALS (IF g AND o THEN `the level-4 clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` TIMES min p 1 ELSE 0)
                                    AND a AT MOST `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` (`clothing case` g o (p PLUS 0.1) (p PLUS 0.1)))
                            `tenths to 1.5`)
                    `both booleans`)
            `both booleans`

-- §1ו over every track, position and approval: within the cap exactly up
-- to it or with approval; a principal's cap outside the reforms is the
-- highest, Ofek Hadash's the lowest.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                        all (GIVEN a YIELD
                                    `employment within the cap` t p a EQUALS (p AT MOST `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` t OR a)
                                AND `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` t AT MOST `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` `a principal outside the reforms`
                                AND `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` `a teacher in Ofek Hadash` AT MOST `the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` t)
                            `both booleans`)
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            `every track`

-- §2 over rates in tenths: every rate is in some row, two exactly at 0.3
-- and 0.5 (finding b, whole space), the amount is one of those rows', and
-- it never falls; finding e over the same rates: the two readings part
-- for a full-position teacher exactly below 0.5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                LET rows MEANS `the amounts the table gives for rate` r
                    a MEANS `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` r
                IN      count rows AT LEAST 1
                    AND (count rows EQUALS 2) EQUALS (r EQUALS 0.3 OR r EQUALS 0.5)
                    AND elem a rows
                    AND a AT MOST `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` (r PLUS 0.1)
                    AND (NOT (a EQUALS `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` 1)) EQUALS (r LESS THAN 0.5))
            `tenths to 1.5`

-- §3 over every profession list and position: never negative, never above
-- the larger grant pro rata, never falling with a larger position; the two
-- readings of finding d part exactly for a teacher on both lists.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                        LET t MEANS `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` l p
                        IN      t AT LEAST 0
                            AND t AT MOST `the value of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ו/8` TIMES min p 1
                            AND t AT MOST `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ו/8` l (p PLUS 0.1))
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            `every profession list checked of circular תשע"ו/8`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                (NOT (`both grants added of circular תשע"ו/8` l EQUALS `the full-position technological allowance` l))
                EQUALS (`teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with shoes and two coats` l
                        AND `teaches a profession in circular תשע"ו/8 on` `the professions with two coats` l))
            `every profession list checked of circular תשע"ו/8`

-- §1ו over every track: the limits as printed include 140%, and the cap
-- adopted is among them (finding f for the principal).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD
                    elem 1.4 (`the limits §1ו sets` t)
                AND elem (`the employment cap of circular תשע"ו/8` t) (`the limits §1ו sets` t))
            `every track`
